      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bridgehampton%2C_New_York",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Bridgehampton’s first library opened in 1793 in a private home on Ocean Road, founded by reformed criminal Stephen Burroughs.",
